Mitigating Greenhouse Gas Emissions from Crop Production and Management Practices, and Livestock: A Review
Nkulu Rolly Kabange 1,* , Youngho Kwon 1 , So-Myeong Lee 1 , Ju-Won Kang 1, Jin-Kyung Cha 1 , Hyeonjin Park 1, Gamenyah Daniel Dzorkpe 2, Dongjin Shin 1 , Ki-Won Oh 1 and Jong-Hee Lee 1,*
